HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra1031.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra1032.fits,spectra1033.fits, spectra1034.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1035.fits,spectra1036.fits, spectra1037.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1038.fits,spectra1039.fits, spectra1040.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1041.fits,spectra1042.fits, spectra1043.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1044.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 0.9272467450276145, 0.9749840923589072,0.9607743886140566,              HISTORY 0.9666743247205046, 0.9425684508315555,1.0330882966864159,              HISTORY 0.9963648791231663, 1.0036617426310006,0.9440580404751939,              HISTORY 1.0212592090706418, 1.0084408630640014,1.0154350440626034,              HISTORY 1.0202242119665563, 1.0082143982451897.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             